<title>SWEDEN: Esselte lifts '96 dividend to 5.0 SKR.</title>
<headline>Esselte lifts '96 dividend to 5.0 SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish office supplier Esselte posts its results for the 12 months to December 31, 1996, with slight revisions to preliminary figures released in mid-January.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Dividend (SKR)			     5.00 vs   4.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				667 vs    594</p>
<p> Sales					11,625 vs 12,154</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		12.50 vs  11.00</p>
<p> Cost of sold items			7,835 vs  8,127</p>
<p> Sales and admin costs		   3,093 vs  3,314</p>
<p> Operating profit			    697 vs    713</p>
<p> Net financial items		 CHARGE 30 vs    119 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					     238 vs    218</p>
<p> Net profit				    429 vs    376</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
